WEBVTT

00:37.540 --> 00:39.250
This is my path...

00:46.220 --> 00:47.700
This is my story...

00:56.240 --> 00:57.710
...to becoming
the Supreme Commander.

00:58.260 --> 01:01.970
...of becoming a Hero!

01:09.060 --> 01:13.050
When I gently wake up

01:14.080 --> 01:18.160
I find myself covered in darkness

01:18.920 --> 01:26.500
As tears fall one by one,
I endure my own grief

01:26.500 --> 01:29.400
I vowed to hold that hope in my hands

01:43.380 --> 01:46.540
I've been dreaming of it for a long time

01:48.420 --> 01:52.420
A dream that feels
so distant and unreachable

01:53.440 --> 01:57.600
I kept hoping that it would come true

01:58.400 --> 02:02.980
That's when you reached out to me

02:02.980 --> 02:05.390
"You are always looking forward."

02:05.400 --> 02:08.400
"You are always genuine."

02:08.400 --> 02:12.360
I know I can make it with you

02:12.640 --> 02:18.160
I'll turn this world
into a garden of light

02:18.160 --> 02:23.290
I'll do it for sure,
and lead it to the future

02:39.570 --> 02:43.480
(EPISODE.1 The Birth, Yuuki, The Awakening)
Let the summit begin.

02:43.600 --> 02:47.980
First, a report on the current situation
in Mato from our country's personnel.

02:51.940 --> 02:55.120
You work me hard,
morning after morning.

02:55.280 --> 02:58.540
But thanks to you, we have it easy.

03:00.400 --> 03:02.000
Don't skip your part!

03:02.000 --> 03:03.960
(Yuuki Wakura)

03:04.320 --> 03:07.020
I mean, look at this sparkling class!

03:07.020 --> 03:10.980
We're helpless dust in front of
your housekeeping abilities.

03:10.980 --> 03:11.000
Well, I'm not denying that.
We're helpless dust in front of
your housekeeping abilities.

03:11.000 --> 03:13.110
Well, I'm not denying that.

03:13.110 --> 03:14.430
Morning!

03:14.430 --> 03:16.140
Morning too!

03:16.640 --> 03:18.900
Here come our young queens,
coming late as always.

03:18.900 --> 03:20.100
Can't be helped.

03:20.540 --> 03:23.070
Men can't get blessings from Peaches.

03:23.640 --> 03:26.690
From the moment we're born,
our lives are on hard difficulty.

03:26.940 --> 03:28.660
Wakura!

03:28.980 --> 03:30.620
Please fix this.

03:30.960 --> 03:33.080
Okay, leave it to me.

03:35.050 --> 03:36.700
Quick work as always.

03:37.140 --> 03:40.340
Though, it wouldn't make me
popular with girls.

03:40.340 --> 03:41.550
Thank you!

03:41.800 --> 03:44.240
You're even good at that stuff, huh?

03:44.240 --> 03:46.400
My big sister taught me.

03:46.400 --> 03:50.180
Since men can't get powers from Peaches,
they must polish their own skills.

03:50.540 --> 03:53.390
And if I didn't do it right,
she'd punish me.

03:53.560 --> 03:55.140
Poor guy.

03:55.140 --> 03:57.810
Wait, but wasn't your sister...

03:57.980 --> 03:58.830
Hey!

04:03.360 --> 04:05.530
(Company Orientation)

04:07.040 --> 04:09.490
It's about time to be
a working adult, huh?

04:13.250 --> 04:15.450
(This Month's Mato Mishaps)

04:17.220 --> 04:19.410
- Sis, wait for me!
- I wonder if I am going to work

04:19.410 --> 04:21.540
- Hurry up!
- and living a normal life.

04:22.260 --> 04:28.400
Isn't there something or somewhere
I could be useful?

04:31.200 --> 04:33.310
It sure is foggy this evening.

04:34.240 --> 04:36.020
I can't see anything in front of me.

04:38.180 --> 04:39.390
Don't tell me...

04:46.780 --> 04:47.820
I am now in...

04:47.860 --> 04:48.320
(Demon)

04:49.080 --> 04:49.500
(Capital)

04:50.280 --> 04:51.110
(Demon Capital Mato)

04:51.900 --> 04:52.940
Mato?!

04:53.570 --> 04:57.480
I need to calm down.
Let's open the manual.

04:58.000 --> 05:00.520
We will answer any questions
about Mato Mishaps.

05:00.520 --> 05:03.780
Mato refers to alternate dimension
connected through gates

05:03.780 --> 05:07.120
that suddenly appeared
in various places in Japan.

05:07.120 --> 05:12.240
Damages caused by Shuuki in our world or
civilians who happen to wander into Mato

05:12.240 --> 05:13.550
are called Mato Mishaps.

05:14.020 --> 05:16.060
If you happen to be lost in Mato,

05:16.060 --> 05:19.280
do not go anywhere and wait
for the Demon Defense Force.

05:20.320 --> 05:23.070
Alright, as long as I stay put...

05:40.020 --> 05:41.500
This is too much...

05:55.260 --> 05:56.970
I don't want to die...

05:56.970 --> 05:58.300
(Death Casualty)

05:58.480 --> 06:00.520
in this place—

06:06.920 --> 06:08.100
A human?

06:08.460 --> 06:10.420
Are you a victim of the Mato Mishap?

06:11.460 --> 06:14.110
You sure are one unlucky guy
to get attacked right away.

06:17.740 --> 06:20.140
Brace yourselves,
all you ugly Shuukis.

06:20.140 --> 06:21.790
Time to submit!

06:44.460 --> 06:46.060
It was a weakling after all.

06:51.060 --> 06:53.260
No worries. I'll save you.

06:53.880 --> 06:57.280
I'm Kyoka Uzen, the Commander of
the Demon Defense Force 7th Squad.

06:57.280 --> 06:59.240
(Kyoka Uzen)

07:00.180 --> 07:02.200
Stay behind me.

07:05.680 --> 07:08.730
Isn't this a bad news?

07:12.880 --> 07:13.520
Get on.

07:14.600 --> 07:15.540
Hurry!

07:15.540 --> 07:16.760
Yes, Ma'am!

07:23.300 --> 07:24.880
My apologies!

07:24.880 --> 07:27.030
Don't talk or you'll bite your tongue!

07:37.800 --> 07:38.720
Commander!

07:38.720 --> 07:41.720
Himari Azuma, Nei Okawamura,

07:41.720 --> 07:43.780
and Syusyu Suruga
of the 7th Squad have arrived!

07:43.780 --> 07:45.980
(Syusyu Suruga)
(Himari Azuma)(Nei Okawamura)

07:46.440 --> 07:47.480
What's the situation?

07:47.480 --> 07:50.960
We haven't found
any other victims in the area.

07:51.480 --> 07:53.220
Expand the search area!

07:53.220 --> 07:54.100
Yes, Ma'am!

08:00.640 --> 08:04.010
Groups of Shuukis are coming
toward us from 6 and 9 o'clock.

08:04.320 --> 08:07.140
Please deal with them.
I will protect him.

08:07.140 --> 08:08.340
Roger that!

08:08.340 --> 08:09.480
Man over there.

08:09.840 --> 08:12.200
If you want to be saved,
don't do anything unnecessary

08:12.200 --> 08:13.940
and follow the Commander's order!

08:20.220 --> 08:21.640
Don't get in her way!

08:35.820 --> 08:39.940
Among women who got their powers from
Peaches that can only harvested in Mato,

08:39.940 --> 08:44.860
there are combat specialists,
the Demon Defense Force.

08:44.860 --> 08:46.760
I did hear rumors about them, but...

08:54.240 --> 08:55.340
So this is...

08:56.620 --> 08:58.480
This is the real Demon Defense Force!

09:05.700 --> 09:06.990
That was the last of it.

09:07.480 --> 09:08.720
Is he okay?

09:08.720 --> 09:11.460
He is unconscious
but doesn't seem to be injured.

09:11.780 --> 09:14.670
Way to go, Nei.
You did a good job finding him.

09:15.360 --> 09:16.920
Keep up the good work for a bit longer.

09:16.920 --> 09:17.970
Thank you.

09:17.970 --> 09:19.880
I'm at my limit, too.

09:20.240 --> 09:22.090
You need to increase
your stamina, Syusyu.

09:22.380 --> 09:25.550
That's what Commander told me too.

09:25.800 --> 09:29.140
Has Commander arrived
at the dormitory by now?

09:29.580 --> 09:30.520
Good question.

09:30.940 --> 09:34.120
I feel bad for you,
but we have a kid here.

09:34.120 --> 09:36.260
Let's hurry up and
clean the rest at other sites.

09:36.260 --> 09:38.220
It's fine, I will do my best.

09:38.220 --> 09:41.900
Himarin, you've missed
Commander's sword fighting.

09:41.900 --> 09:43.740
It's too bad indeed,
but it can't be helped.

09:44.440 --> 09:45.780
Already awake?

09:45.780 --> 09:47.790
You have been a victim of
the Mato Mishap.

09:47.790 --> 09:49.700
Where's my sister?

09:51.980 --> 09:54.400
Where do you take me?

09:54.400 --> 09:58.460
There are three actions
a victim should take inside Mato.

09:59.300 --> 10:02.440
One, keep quiet and wait for rescue.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.500
Two, if you encounter a Shuuki,

10:04.500 --> 10:07.430
prioritize your own safety and
escape as far as possible.

10:08.000 --> 10:10.390
Three, don't waste your time talking.

10:13.480 --> 10:14.500
Why are you stopping—

10:20.140 --> 10:20.980
Don't!

10:21.340 --> 10:22.320
That girl!

10:32.980 --> 10:34.120
Dodge to the right!

10:35.520 --> 10:37.220
The reflexes are slow!

10:42.620 --> 10:43.840
No!

10:55.680 --> 10:57.560
I put up a temporary barrier.

10:57.560 --> 10:59.160
Don't panic.

11:02.720 --> 11:03.650
But...

11:05.180 --> 11:07.610
If it were just me, I could handle it.

11:11.300 --> 11:15.760
I got unlucky
with this peach's blessing.

11:17.820 --> 11:20.420
Even if Kyoka herself is strong,
her ability isn't.

11:20.820 --> 11:24.170
Her dream to become the Supreme
Commander will always remain a dream.

11:24.500 --> 11:26.140
Screw it!

11:26.140 --> 11:30.140
I swear I will become Supreme Commander
who can manage all other commanders.

11:33.760 --> 11:37.240
I've never tested it out on a man,
thinking it'd be pointless.

11:37.240 --> 11:38.700
But I have to make a decision now.

11:39.820 --> 11:41.520
You there, what's your name?

11:41.520 --> 11:44.380
I-It's Wakura. Yuuki Wakura.

11:44.380 --> 11:44.980
Yuuki.

11:45.320 --> 11:48.940
I need your help to get us out of here.

11:48.940 --> 11:49.950
Really!?

11:50.360 --> 11:52.280
If it means saving us, I'll do anything.

11:52.280 --> 11:54.660
Well said.
Then starting right now...

11:55.520 --> 11:57.620
I'll make you my slave.

11:58.700 --> 11:59.680
Huh?

12:00.460 --> 12:03.880
Can you move away from him a bit
and keep your eyes closed?

12:03.880 --> 12:05.120
Okay.

12:05.120 --> 12:06.100
Thank you.

12:08.980 --> 12:13.120
If you're enhanced,
we can escape and survive this place.

12:13.120 --> 12:16.390
You mean, I'll be fighting those guys?

12:17.860 --> 12:20.100
You said you'll do anything, didn't you?

12:20.860 --> 12:21.810
Here they are!

12:22.020 --> 12:23.270
Commander?

12:27.080 --> 12:29.050
Time to submit.

12:31.140 --> 12:34.620
At this moment, I,
who had never touched a girl before,

12:34.940 --> 12:39.750
licked her finger which was
offered to me very naturally

12:40.620 --> 12:42.060
like it was a matter of course.

13:04.060 --> 13:04.520
(Eternal)

13:06.150 --> 13:06.610
(Chains)

13:08.980 --> 13:09.940
(Eternal Chains: Slave)

13:13.700 --> 13:15.060
This is...

13:17.180 --> 13:20.840
That man became Commander's slave?

13:32.440 --> 13:35.810
Magnificent! I never thought
you'd get this strong.

13:41.540 --> 13:44.770
Show me your strength, Yuuki!

14:10.860 --> 14:12.420
Jump to the left!

14:16.080 --> 14:17.800
His reflexes are great too!

14:21.080 --> 14:21.960
Take care of this girl.

14:21.960 --> 14:23.240
Yes, Ma'am.

14:23.240 --> 14:24.240
Big sis!

14:24.240 --> 14:25.480
Ryota!

14:26.440 --> 14:27.330
Commander!

14:32.920 --> 14:33.820
So huge.

14:34.180 --> 14:37.340
I will take care of that.
Stay back with those kids.

14:37.660 --> 14:38.530
Yes, Ma'am!

14:39.620 --> 14:40.990
Dive in there, Yuuki!

14:41.300 --> 14:43.200
Give it everything you've got!

15:02.340 --> 15:03.770
Amazing.

15:07.000 --> 15:10.650
Who is that man exactly?

15:21.940 --> 15:23.870
What was that just now?

15:24.820 --> 15:25.680
Commander!

15:25.680 --> 15:26.960
Go back first.

15:28.000 --> 15:29.960
I need to talk to him.

15:31.740 --> 15:32.920
I understand.

15:34.380 --> 15:38.380
I'm surprised
you'd have so much power.

15:38.600 --> 15:42.350
You can continue to work as my slave.

15:42.500 --> 15:44.310
I have to keep at it?

15:44.560 --> 15:48.770
But first, I have to explain
about my ability to you.

15:59.980 --> 16:02.540
So this is what you want, you pervert.

16:02.540 --> 16:03.330
Huh?

16:03.620 --> 16:05.600
This is the price of my ability.

16:05.600 --> 16:09.160
As a master,
I'm obligated to reward my slaves

16:09.160 --> 16:12.290
each time they complete a task.

16:12.380 --> 16:13.760
A reward?

16:13.760 --> 16:16.150
That kiss was a reward?

16:17.140 --> 16:20.850
Since you worked pretty hard,
shall I do it again?

16:21.080 --> 16:23.430
No! That's okay!

16:23.430 --> 16:25.890
I'm the one who was saved,
so you don't have to...

16:31.960 --> 16:35.820
I also didn't know this would happen.

16:35.960 --> 16:40.260
When I took Shuukis as my slaves,
I only had to give them some pork.

16:40.260 --> 16:41.530
What do you mean!?

16:41.760 --> 16:46.240
My body is moving
regardless of my will.

16:46.600 --> 16:48.560
This is the price of my ability.

16:48.560 --> 16:52.130
I never thought I'd do this kind of thing.

17:20.920 --> 17:23.109
We've secured two victims.

17:23.300 --> 17:25.280
Please be ready to accept them.

17:25.280 --> 17:26.599
Roger that.

17:31.160 --> 17:35.960
I never thought my first kiss
would happen in Mato.

17:38.720 --> 17:39.980
These Shuukis...

17:41.180 --> 17:44.120
If even one of them was able to
enter our world,

17:44.120 --> 17:45.840
there would be a dozen casualties.

17:46.820 --> 17:49.840
My goal is to become the Supreme Commander
of the Demon Defense Force

17:49.840 --> 17:52.800
and exterminate Shuukis
as soon as possible.

17:52.800 --> 17:54.810
Our current commander is too lax.

17:55.140 --> 17:58.660
I can use my ability
to the fullest with you.

17:58.660 --> 18:01.280
I might be able to reach that position.

18:01.860 --> 18:04.410
Work for me, Yuuki.

18:08.000 --> 18:12.500
I'm not that good
at academics or sports.

18:12.500 --> 18:15.680
All I really have confidence in
is doing housework, but...

18:16.220 --> 18:18.480
If you can do the housework,
all the better.

18:18.480 --> 18:19.260
Huh?

18:19.260 --> 18:22.670
Besides, you risked yourself
to protect that girl.

18:24.600 --> 18:26.640
It's a sight to see for a man.

18:30.620 --> 18:31.950
In that case...

18:34.200 --> 18:38.270
In that case,
I want to become a hero here!

18:40.620 --> 18:41.730
We have a deal.

18:44.200 --> 18:46.500
Even if I get a job in that world,

18:46.500 --> 18:49.520
all that awaits me are
rigid and boring days.

18:50.480 --> 18:54.120
Here, I can subjugate Shuukis
like I did earlier.

18:57.220 --> 18:59.170
I can avenge my big sister.

19:00.680 --> 19:01.860
Not to mention...

19:02.440 --> 19:07.090
If I can get rewards from Miss Kyoka,
it'll be worth the effort.

19:14.300 --> 19:16.800
So, this is the dormitory
for the Demon Defense Force.

19:16.810 --> 19:18.270
(Demon Defense Force 7th Squad Dormitory)

19:19.040 --> 19:21.820
From the look of it, it's just an inn.

19:22.700 --> 19:25.880
It was built according to
Mato's Yin and Yang principles.

19:25.880 --> 19:27.950
This dorm is also equipped
with a powerful barrier.

19:30.260 --> 19:33.220
We will take care of
all the troublesome paperwork.

19:33.620 --> 19:34.410
Get in.

19:34.760 --> 19:37.440
This is your new workplace.

19:37.440 --> 19:38.120
Yes, Ma'am!

19:38.940 --> 19:39.820
That's right.

19:40.360 --> 19:41.790
I can become one too.

19:43.640 --> 19:45.480
Become a member of
the Demon Defense Force.

19:46.580 --> 19:47.720
Welcome back.

19:48.760 --> 19:51.700
We have sent the siblings
to their parents.

19:51.700 --> 19:52.430
Good job.

19:54.220 --> 19:56.390
And what about him?

19:57.180 --> 20:00.560
He's Yuuki Wakura,
and will work here as the caretaker.

20:00.560 --> 20:01.120
Huh?

20:01.150 --> 20:02.360
(Caretaker)

20:04.240 --> 20:06.700
Hold on a sec!
A caretaker?

20:06.700 --> 20:09.380
During a battle, you'll be my slave.

20:09.380 --> 20:11.780
Outside of that,
you'll be this dorm's caretaker.

20:13.860 --> 20:15.950
I went to all-girls schools.

20:15.950 --> 20:18.240
I never had the chance
to see boys up close,

20:18.240 --> 20:19.820
I'm looking forward to it!

20:19.820 --> 20:22.420
A new member in our dorm...

20:22.420 --> 20:24.380
That means I got a junior!

20:24.380 --> 20:27.880
A man becomes our caretaker?

20:28.440 --> 20:31.960
These girls are skilled,
but a bit difficult to handle.

20:31.960 --> 20:35.600
Considering the presence of Shuuki,
it's hard for the caretakers to settle in.

20:36.020 --> 20:38.860
Thankfully, you're good
at housework, a perfect fit.

20:38.860 --> 20:41.560
Wasn't I going to be a member of
the Demon Defense Force?

20:41.960 --> 20:44.270
A man can't become a member of
the Demon Defense Force.

20:46.060 --> 20:47.240
That's the gist of it.

20:47.240 --> 20:49.110
Everyone, treat him well.

20:49.110 --> 20:51.340
If the Commander says so...

20:51.940 --> 20:54.880
The garbage has been piling up,
deal with it!

20:54.880 --> 20:57.950
I'm starving.
Make me something to eat!

20:58.200 --> 21:00.660
Clean my uniform as well.

21:00.880 --> 21:04.130
Wait! Don't put all this
on me at once!

21:04.360 --> 21:05.540
It'll be okay.

21:05.540 --> 21:09.090
I joined the 7th Squad just before you.

21:09.180 --> 21:12.660
I'll support you as your senior,
so rest assured.

21:12.660 --> 21:14.520
Thanks.

21:14.520 --> 21:15.550
How old are you?

21:15.900 --> 21:17.510
I am eleven years old.

21:17.780 --> 21:21.980
She's your superior in the 7th Squad,
so don't you dare disobey her!

21:22.740 --> 21:25.240
An elementary school is my superior...

21:25.240 --> 21:26.690
Anyway, Yuuki.

21:29.020 --> 21:32.630
Welcome to Mato's Elite Troop 7th Squad.

21:37.000 --> 21:37.920
Thank you!

21:41.030 --> 21:44.680
Hey, why don't you try to relax?

21:44.680 --> 21:49.680
If we hold each other hands,
we'll be invincible

21:49.680 --> 21:54.380
Our hands are linked together
in the chain that holding you

21:54.380 --> 21:56.630
I'll never let you go

22:12.240 --> 22:16.260
Effort alone is not enough

22:16.260 --> 22:20.030
Sometimes things just happen
out of the blue

22:20.140 --> 22:22.310
But it's easy to change

22:22.310 --> 22:28.190
A special relationship starts
from the encounter with you

22:28.190 --> 22:36.240
These shaking feelings and body heat
are anxiety which comes from you

22:36.240 --> 22:43.090
My heart beats faster
with each twist or two

22:43.090 --> 22:46.620
Hey, why don't you try to relax?

22:46.620 --> 22:51.700
If we hold each other hands,
we'll be invincible

22:51.700 --> 22:57.050
Our hands are linked together
transmitting sympathy

22:57.050 --> 22:59.250
In the chain that holding you

22:59.250 --> 23:03.660
I'll never let you go again

23:03.660 --> 23:06.950
I'll never let you go

23:11.480 --> 23:13.120
Please teach us, Senior Nei!

23:13.120 --> 23:17.120
This time we will talk about
Commander Kyoka's peach blessing, the Slave.

23:17.120 --> 23:19.590
This is a power can turn
someone into her slave.

23:19.590 --> 23:22.880
After that, she has to reward them.

23:22.880 --> 23:27.080
She gives meat to the Shuuki,
so I wonder what our caretaker gets.

23:27.080 --> 23:28.080
I'm really curious!

23:28.080 --> 23:31.560
Her swordsmanship isn't
part of her blessing,

23:31.560 --> 23:33.220
that is the result of her own training.

23:33.220 --> 23:35.420
There's no other people than her
that could do that.

23:35.420 --> 23:36.580
She's really amazing, right?

23:36.580 --> 23:39.190
(Interest, Syusyu, Bare Skin)
Next episode:
Interest, Syusyu, Bare Skin.

23:39.190 --> 23:41.030
Please watch!
